{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1567987200, "end_date": 1568591999, "month_true_total": 107, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:52:59 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55128033", "author": {"steamid": "76561198129068154", "personaname": "光圈中国CEO", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ApertureCN/", "num_games_owned": 586, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 2899, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 329, "last_played": 1658233566, "avatar": "84992536b33f61558390f33c797fd26e2537765c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "说路人不友好的我真没看出来哪里不友好了，今天免费体验玩了几个小时，感觉虽然很多外国人但是大家可以通过信号交流。这个游戏给人一种不同于恐怖游戏的紧张刺激的感觉，而且地图随机生成不会很快就感觉枯燥，只要任务形式更新的快、再多出几个不同的人物、再加入PVP竞赛模式等等，可以很好地保持新鲜感。对的起这个价格，推荐入手", "timestamp_created": 1568567283, "timestamp_updated": 1568567283, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516472280025482178", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55126431", "author": {"steamid": "76561198177866899", "personaname": "以华夏之名", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198177866899/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4961, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 790, "last_played": 1776843120, "avatar": "449b54672fcc75dcd27d1d779da4069851c7e89a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这么好玩的游戏我居然现在才知道。", "timestamp_created": 1568561268, "timestamp_updated": 1568561268, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516400337219238281", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55124277", "author": {"steamid": "76561198155170825", "personaname": "⎛⎝MikazukiSora⎠⎞", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/562052781/", "num_games_owned": 280, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 189892, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 44938, "last_played": 1719844466, "avatar": "046ec4ea8d48492819fda1d72c528463b1e692d4"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "放在18年这个游戏还能算作一个和朋友一起愉快的挖一挖外星地区的矿，看看外星地形顺便打打小虫子的休闲游戏。\n随着慢慢更新，变成了一个主要看打怪，抵抗外星生物的打怪合作游戏。\n制作组很良心，不断的在制作新的玩法，新模式，新武器，新地形，新时装等，关注了\n\n————给萌新\n这个最多支持4人组队的游戏最好是和小伙伴们一起开黑玩耍，100%可破坏的地形是有很大的乐趣的。\n不过在正式开始挖矿之旅之前还是先熟悉一下各个职业的分工\n建议去低难度熟悉打发之后再去高难度玩，提高自己的娱乐性的同时还不会坑到队友。\n联网的话这个游戏是没有专门服务器的，相当于直接连房主的网络，如果是同样运营商的网络是可以有非常好的游戏体验的。\n\n另外来说这个游戏的DLC一个是支持者包，里面有特殊颜色ID（金色）、和没有什么用也不怎么好看的装备时装+武器皮肤，不会对这个游戏有任何的加成或者特权，慎入。还有一个是音乐包。可以不入。剩余的都是时装，可以看经济情况个人喜好决定入不入\n\n如果没有大佬带的话可以+群260920298", "timestamp_created": 1568553487, "timestamp_updated": 1637419105, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55122797", "author": {"steamid": "76561198340636701", "personaname": "夜深", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198340636701/", "num_games_owned": 150, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 24633, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9132, "last_played": 1753109139, "avatar": "d4371bdba4c8c3484bc5b88edc6ee3c15d2bc250"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "如果单纯是游玩的话购买本体即可。\nDLC并不是什么关键道具，只是一些外观和ost，作为支持开发者的渠道而已。\n快乐开黑游戏，对本人来说100小时以内都很有新鲜感，制作组每次更新也较为有诚意。\n不过联机体验主要取决于主机网络质量，略有些捉鸡，如果是校园网的朋友最好估摸一下次元壁厚度再作决定是否购买XD\n", "timestamp_created": 1568547524, "timestamp_updated": 1568547524, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.559049069881439209", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55119701", "author": {"steamid": "76561198383708832", "personaname": "Jio", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/liesX/", "num_games_owned": 214, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 3142, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 199, "last_played": 1732101579, "avatar": "3dd9229b07ea24b45b19ab4b918d76e03efc7528"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "haowan", "timestamp_created": 1568533380, "timestamp_updated": 1672504531, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}